AltoRewardsDistributor::claimRewardTokensWithAdapters
├── when adapter payment token share total exceeds MATH_PRECISION
│   └── it should revert
├── when adapters provide bonus discounts
│   ├── it should apply adapter bonus discount
│   ├── it should transfer payment token share to adapter receiver
│   ├── it should emit PaymentShareTransferred event
│   └── it should emit ClaimRewardTokens event with combined discount
├── when discount reaches MAX_DISCOUNT
│   ├── it should cap discount at MAX_DISCOUNT
│   └── it should emit ClaimRewardTokens event with capped discount
├── when adapter has zero payment token share
│   ├── it should apply adapter bonus discount
│   └── it should not transfer any payment tokens to adapter receiver
├── when adapter has zero address receiver
│   └── it should not revert and should work normally
├── when adapter receiver is distributor contract
│   └── it should not send additional tokens to distributor
└── when multiple adapters provide payment shares
    ├── it should transfer correct payment shares to both adapter receivers
    └── it should emit PaymentShareTransferred event for each adapter
